<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Asset downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Asset downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney said Monday it had cut its rating for United Asset Management Corp to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Boston institutional management services company were off 1/2 to 23-7/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
